Author: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 3 15:50:53 2026 +0000

    fix(cabinet): fail-closed shell identity reconcile dead-end UI
    
    After one bounded refresh per stale pair, show a reload affordance instead
    of an endless skeleton or mismatched private page content.
    
    Co-authored-by: Аведикян Карен <karenavedikyan@users.noreply.github.com>

